[en.DECISION_C08_MANEHATTAN_SUPPLY_NORTHERN_HOOFLYN]
Reinforce Northern Hooflyn

[en.DECISION_C08_MANEHATTAN_SUPPLY_NORTHERN_HOOFLYN_desc]
Northern Hooflyn is the gateway to the south. Reinforcing Northern Hooflyn will help ensure the smooth progress of military operations.

[zh.DECISION_C08_MANEHATTAN_SUPPLY_NORTHERN_HOOFLYN]
增援北蹄林城

[zh.DECISION_C08_MANEHATTAN_SUPPLY_NORTHERN_HOOFLYN_desc]
北蹄林城是通向南方的门户。若想发起军事行动，增援北蹄林城有助于保障军事行动顺利。
